  "$id": "owner-beta-paper-operations-v1.schema.json",
  "title": "Owner-beta Paper operation wires v1",
  "$comment": "Untrusted wire only. Enforce canonical bytes <=65536 and depth <=16 before decode; semantic cross-field, clock, identity, sorted-array and authority checks are mandatory in the source contract.",
